Manages third-party sign-in providers

Usage: leptoskit auth provider <COMMAND>

Commands:
  add   Adds `[auth.providers.<id>]` to leptoskit.toml, naming the environment variables its secrets go in, and prints how to set the provider up
  help  Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
